                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today in West Hollywood, I joined @PPFA, patients, and healthcare providers to introduce the Restoring Essential Healthcare Act \u2014 reversing the GOP\u2019s ban on Medicaid reimbursements to Planned Parenthood.\n\nCare like cancer screenings and STI tests is essential. I won\u2019t stop fighting to protect our healthcare from Republican\u2019s attacks.\n \nThe GOP\u2019s Big, Bad Bill didn\u2019t just target reproductive care \u2014 it blocked millions from affordable, basic healthcare.\n\nOur bill restores that \u2014 because no one should lose care over politics.\n \nProud to lead this fight from LA to DC with @RepNikema, @RepChrisPappas, @SenTinaSmith, @PattyMurray, @PPFA \u2014 and 130+ cosponsors.\n\nWe\u2019re standing up for healthcare as a right.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
                    "PPFA"
                ],
                "text_tagged_users_ids": [
                    "402957663"
                ],
                "text_tags": null,
