                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The latest numbers from the Congressional Budget Office are even worse. The Republican\u2019s Big, Bad Law will kick 10 million hardworking Americans off their healthcare and raise ACA premiums.\n\nAll to give billionaires a $1 trillion blank check while forcing more Americans into medical debt. It\u2019s diabolical and I won\u2019t stop fighting to protect and expand affordable care.",
