                "text": "CHLA performs miracles everyday right here in my district. These layoffs are heartbreaking for both the world class staff that work at CHLA, and the patients that come through their doors.\n\nI won't stop fighting to make sure that our hospitals and clinics have the support they need to take care of our children and communities.\n\nhttps://t.co/64nN3XU0TN",
