                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Celebrating Labor Day with California\u2019s incredible union members, including ILWU, IBEW, SEIU, Carpenters, and so many more. \n\nThey\u2019re the fuel driving our economy from clean energy to rail to our hospitals to the food on our table, and everything in between. I\u2019ll always have their back.",
