                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Vista Social",
                "text": "I had the chance to meet with leaders from the Hollywood Presbyterian Medical Center to discuss their work in our district and planned expansion to serve more patients.\n\nHollywood Presbyterian Hospital is a safety net for so many in Los Angeles, and I\u2019ll continue to support efforts to increase access to care for Angelenos.",
