                "text": "Hospitals like @CHAHPMedCenter are sounding the alarm that they could shut down or be forced to drastically reduce services to patients in need because of the Republican healthcare cuts.\n\nWhat they're saying should shock you. Take a listen   \u2b07\ufe0f https://t.co/FyyW5VxfpC",
