                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined patients & frontline healthcare workers to condemn the Republican attempt to drain trillions of dollars from our healthcare system, throw millions of American citizens off Medicare, and raise your insurance rates to give tax breaks to millionaires.\n\nI refuse to rubber stamp this administration\u2019s cruelty.\n\nTake a listen to the highlights \u00a0\u2b07\ufe0f",
