                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Vista Social",
                "text": "If you\u2019re on Covered California, the Republican Shutdown Sham budget means your healthcare costs will increase as much as 97% next year.\n\nCalifornians simply can't afford that. 400,000 are expected to lose their coverage entirely.\n\nI will not let Republicans bully you into making impossible choices, like skipping a meal just to afford a check-up. \n\nhttps://t.co/nJUPoCZGQd",
