                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I visited Skyline Healthcare & Wellness Center, one of the many in-home care centers in my district which serves numerous Americans on Medicaid and Medicare.\n\nBoth Skyline and the patients they serve are worried sick about Republican cuts to Medicaid. I refuse to rubber stamp a future where those in my district have to choose between expensive healthcare, or pain and suffering. You can count on me to hold the line.",
